### Get all categories
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories

### Get category by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/categories/1

### Initialize default categories
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories/initialize

### Get all products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### Get product by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1

### Get my products (requires authentication)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/my-products
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

### Search products by title
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/search?title=shirt

### Create new product (requires authentication)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Blue Denim Jacket",
  "description": "High-quality denim jacket in excellent condition",
  "price": 45.99,
  "size": "M",
  "condition": "Good",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/image.jpg",
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Update product (requires authentication)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Blue Denim Jacket",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "price": 40.99,
  "size": "M",
  "condition": "Very Good",
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/updated-image.jpg",
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Delete product (requires authentication)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN